ARCHDUMP2>>{
  "foundContainer": true,
  "htmlHead": "<div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded border border-line p-0.5\"><button type=\"button\" title=\"事实泳道：谁依赖谁\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors bg-surfaceHi text-brass\">版式图</button><button type=\"button\" title=\"可拖拽 · 可交 Archify 出图\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors text-fgMuted hover:text-fg\">画布</button></div><span class=\"text-2xs text-fgFaint\">两张都是军火库按当前选型现画的；画布那张还能拖、能隐藏节点、能一键交 Archify 出交互图</span></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-fgMuted\">横向色带是 7 层，方块是 33 个槽位；左侧竖直箭头表示请求自上而下穿过各层， 层内的 <span class=\"mono\">→</span> 是请求真正流经的顺序，竖虚线右侧是旁路件 （只在发布期起作用，请求不经过它）。方块右上角的「必需 / 建议」是该槽位<span class=\"text-fg\">留空时的性质</span>，不是当前状态。</p><div class=\"panel p-2.5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded border border-line p-0.5\"><button type=\"button\" title=\"点方块看它的角色与代价\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors bg-surfaceHi text-brass\">查看</button><button type=\"button\" title=\"拆掉这一块会连带影响谁 / 它依赖谁\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors text-fgMuted hover:text-fg\">可达追溯</button><button type=\"button\" title=\"两个槽位之间的最短有向通路\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors text-fgMuted hover:text-fg\">通路探测</button><button type=\"button\" title=\"对比两条泳道各自提供与索要什么\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors text-fgMuted hover:text-fg\">角色透镜</button><button type=\"button\" title=\"按预设或当前缺口逐章看\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors text-fgMuted hover:text-fg\">导览</button></div><span class=\"text-2xs text-fgFaint\">点击方块操作 · 快捷键 <span class=\"mono\">U</span> 上游 <span class=\"mono\">D</span> 下游 <span class=\"mono\">R</span> 路由 <span class=\"mono\">L</span> 透镜 <span class=\"mono\">P</span> 导览 <span class=\"mono\">Esc</span> 清除</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded border border-line p-0.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors bg-surfaceHi text-brass\">跟随界面</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-2xs transition-colors text-fgMuted hover:text-fg\">文档浅色</button></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded border border-line px-3 py-1.5 text-2xs text-fg transition-colors hover:border-brass hover:text-brass\">下载 SVG</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded border border-line px-3 py-1.5 text-2xs text-fg transition-colors hover:border-brass hover:text-brass\">下载 PNG</button><button type=\"button\" title=\"复制复制 D2 源码\" class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded border transition-colors hover:bg-surfaceHi px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs \" style=\"color: rgb(147, 163, 156); border-color: rgb(36, 48, 41); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[1.05em] leading-none\">⎘</span><span>复制 D2 源码</span></button><button type=\"button\" title=\"复制复制 Mermaid 源码\" class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded border transition-colors hover:bg-surfaceHi px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs \" style=\"color: rgb(147, 163, 156); border-color: rgb(36, 48, 41); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[1.05em] leading-none\">⎘</span><span>复制 Mermaid 源码</span></button></div></div><div class=\"grid-bg overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-line p-3\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 1456 902\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"arsenal-demo\">\n<style>text{dominant-baseline:auto;letter-spacing:0}.mono{font-family:'Cascadia Code','JetBrains Mono',Consolas,monospace}</style>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1456\" height=\"902\" fill=\"#0B0F0E\"></rect>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', Roboto, sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#D9A441\">arsenal-de",
